{{Quote|Built for speed, Rabbits excel at swift movement and quick escapes.}}
'''Rabbit''' (formerly known as '''Mink''') is one of the four [[races]] that players can spawn with when first joining the game, having a 12.5% chance of being obtained.

Rabbit is widely regarded as a mediocre race in the current ''Blox Fruits'' environment, due to the lack of offense. Its main characteristic is the significant amount of speed boosts and mobility that it provides. However, it lacks damage, defense, healing, etc., especially in V4 form.

Nonetheless, its speed actually gives users a good advantage in [[PvP mechanics|PvP]] due to its V4 having amazing mobility for running or catching runners. This, paired with [[Pilot Helmet]], [[Kitsune]] or [[Tiger]] gives you the best speed in game. Rabbit is also known to have one of the hardest trials to complete. (other than [[Draco]]) 

