==Overview==
<tabber>
Pros=
{{Overview|Pros
|'''General'''
* Highest mobility out of all [[Races]], allowing the user to dodge attacks and travel long distance with ease.
* Dashing will technically not cost any energy if the user's [[Stats|Melee]] stat is above 900.
** It actually will take a slight bit, but it regenerates faster than it can waste.
* One of the easiest trials if not the easiest.
* Very good when paired with [[Ice]] or Awakened [[Magma]] because of the speed the player gets while running, if the player has a good amount of [[energy]].

|'''[[Agility]] (V3)'''
* High mobility, able to dodge efficiently and quickly.
* Dashes are extended a lot more.
** Dashes cooldown is also reduced.

|'''Whirlwind (V4)'''
* Drains [[Instinct]].
* Can trap players.
* Good for stopping players chasing after you if you decide to run away.

|'''Lightning Cloak (V4)'''
* Allows the player to dash in the highest speeds in comparison to any race. ([[Cyborg]] ''could'' be an exception.)
* The second tier of this gear grants the player aerial movement and opportunities for surprise attacks or combos.
* Amazing for running or catching runners.
}}

|-|Cons=
{{Overview|Cons
|'''General'''
* Only provides speed buffs. (Apart from the V4 ability Whirlwind, but it still does little damage and is easily escapable.)
* Still can be outpaced by other races and [[blox Fruits|fruits]], despite being the fastest race.

|'''[[Agility]] (V3)'''
* Only provides a speed buff.

|'''Whirlwind (V4)'''
* Can be heavily punished if the user tries to trap an experienced player.
* Can be [[Instinct|Instinct-tricked]].

|'''Lightning Cloak (V4)'''
* The buffs granted in the preceding versions make this gear fall in comparison to other races.
* [F] skills or skills that allow the user to have fast paced movement can overshadow this gear's second tier.
** [[Cyborg]] V4's Energy Control gear at its second tier, paired with [[Skull Guitar]]'s M1 movement glitch could easily outrun the held dash Rabbit's Lightning Cloak's second tier offers.
}}
</tabber>

==Trivia==
* The speed boosts provided by [[accessories]] and [[Tiger]] will stack with Rabbit's speed boost.
** As such, a Rabbit's V3 ability combined with the [[Pilot Helmet]] can reach a speed surpassing even [[Light]]'s [F] (in both versions of the fruit).
* Before the arrival of [[Race Awakening]]s, Rabbit was widely considered the best race for PvP. However, after their introduction, Rabbit fell out of favor and was seen as one of the weaker options. This shift highlighted other races and their V3 abilities' usefulness (such as [[Angel]] and [[Ghoul]]) which have since become some of the most popular choices in the game.
* Even though the Rabbit race is based off rabbits, awakening/unlocking [[Race Awakening|V4]] adds a wolf tail, contrary to the previous appearances.

